{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-adventure/1553654-air-circus-looking-for-ideas","id":1553654,"title":"Air Circus: Looking For Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Adventure!"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-09-05T15:56:08-07:00","id":1553654,"title":"Air Circus: Looking For Ideas","content":"Hi all, looking for ideas.<br /> <br /> Got an Adventure! campaign starting soon.<br /> <br /> I'm trying to figure out how to integrate a member of the Air Circus into the rest of the player group, which consist of players in Branch 9, The Archivist and International Detective Agency.<br /> Air Circus seems to have their own mode of going about things compared to the other Paths. Unless I'm not seeing something.<br /> <br /> Anyway, feedback appreciated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">Organizer for the Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness Meetup. </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","name":"Drumheller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar85_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-05T18:33:05-07:00","id":1553655,"title":"","content":"One idea is a search. While the Air Circus is in Southern California, doing stunt work for a film. A child is kidnapped and taken into the hills of southwestern California. The Air Circus is called to help. <br /> <br /> This allows you to blend Search and Rescue with Western tropes. Complication: The child is a low level Nova (the PCs might be confused as to whether the kid is a mesmerist or a stalwart). She was taken to help find a lost treasure. <br /> <br /> The Air Circus could be in Australia for a variety of reasons. An archeological survey might have heard rumors of strange ruins in the northern half of Western Australia. The Circus could run into something ala Lovecraft. <br /> <br /> Scouting out air mail routes in the South Pacific could bring the Air Circus into conflict with Shamans fearful that the airplanes with discover hidden sacred sites. South Seas pulp occult horror could follow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-09-06T08:06:26-07:00","id":1553668,"title":"","content":"Good stuff. Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">Organizer for the Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness Meetup. </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","name":"Drumheller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar85_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}